    "show_share": true,
    "description": "It's been a year since his graduation from AKU, and Haider Ali, MBBS '18, can empathise with how this year's batch is likely to feel. \"There's certainly a feeling of pride,\" Haider says. \"But there also anxiety as the 'What's Next?' question starts to linger in everyone's mind.\"",
